WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:01.900
Thirty names.

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.260
One pot.

3
00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:05.360
And a boy too young to know

4
00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:06.970
whose name he drew.

5
00:00:07.572 --> 00:00:10.187
Uttaramerur, Tamil Nadu, nine

6
00:00:10.187 --> 00:00:12.112
hundred and nineteen CE.

7
00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:14.732
Its assembly, the Sabha, had its

8
00:00:14.732 --> 00:00:16.652
rules cut into a temple's stone

9
00:00:16.652 --> 00:00:17.662
basement.

10
00:00:18.208 --> 00:00:19.648
Thirty wards.

11
00:00:19.648 --> 00:00:21.628
Each wrote palm leaf tickets,

12
00:00:21.628 --> 00:00:23.528
only for people who owned

13
00:00:23.528 --> 00:00:25.988
taxable land, lived in their own

14
00:00:25.988 --> 00:00:27.688
house, and were known for

15
00:00:27.688 --> 00:00:29.778
learning and clean dealings.

16
00:00:30.142 --> 00:00:32.122
Anyone who had served and not

17
00:00:32.122 --> 00:00:33.982
shown the accounts was barred.

18
00:00:33.982 --> 00:00:36.382
Two years later, the village

19
00:00:36.382 --> 00:00:38.382
revised its rules anyway.

20
00:00:38.382 --> 00:00:40.612
Some things never change.

21
00:00:41.253 --> 00:00:43.193
The whole Mahasabha gathered.

22
00:00:43.193 --> 00:00:45.793
An old priest held the pot high

23
00:00:45.793 --> 00:00:48.133
for all to see, and a boy

24
00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:49.833
too young to know the difference

25
00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:51.543
drew out a bundle.

26
00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:53.912
One ticket was shaken out,

27
00:00:53.912 --> 00:00:55.912
placed in the arbiter's palm,

28
00:00:55.912 --> 00:00:58.172
and read aloud before everyone.

29
00:00:58.172 --> 00:01:00.472
One name from each ward.

30
00:01:00.472 --> 00:01:02.222
Thirty in all.

31
00:01:02.711 --> 00:01:04.491
Those names formed committees

32
00:01:04.491 --> 00:01:06.911
for the year, the gardens, and

33
00:01:06.911 --> 00:01:08.131
the village tank.

34
00:01:08.131 --> 00:01:09.796
They served three hundred and

35
00:01:09.796 --> 00:01:12.381
sixty days, then retired.

36
00:01:12.959 --> 00:01:15.059
The Sabha said why:

37
00:01:15.059 --> 00:01:16.539
so that the wicked of the

38
00:01:16.539 --> 00:01:18.599
village perish, and the good

39
00:01:18.599 --> 00:01:19.629
prosper.

40
00:01:20.892 --> 00:01:22.012
For GS1 and GS2:

41
00:01:22.012 --> 00:01:24.092
the Uttaramerur inscriptions of

42
00:01:24.092 --> 00:01:27.052
Parantaka the First show Chola

43
00:01:27.052 --> 00:01:29.632
local self government, open to

44
00:01:29.632 --> 00:01:30.852
those who qualified:

45
00:01:30.852 --> 00:01:34.342
wards, lots, and fixed terms.

46
00:01:35.288 --> 00:01:38.208
A pot, thirty names, and a

47
00:01:38.208 --> 00:01:39.848
village that wrote its own

48
00:01:39.848 --> 00:01:40.718
rules.
